  "question": {
    "text": "The radius of the circle with centre at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and whose common chord with the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is also a diameter of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Mio06",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "z2P2P",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VYVjB",
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math> unit",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rOjtZ",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the equation of the circle be&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the common chord of these <math><mn>2</mn></math> circles is<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />It passes through the centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2,4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the given circle,&nbsp;so<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Hence, the radius of the circle&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
    "image": null
  },
